{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-32a16f7ed7dc985c7d64","text":"老板，再见狸！","speaker":"狮子狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-3ea05fe51e3c0ef271b7","text":"嘿嘿，咱们果然再见了，老板！","speaker":"狮子狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-e9a98766106a2db3f75c","text":"干嘛要变成招财猫？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-fc3b0def71dbf2554e21","text":"这才不是什么招财猫哩…老板，这明明是守门狮子！","speaker":"狮子狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-1fb5d4ad2985b808cda0","text":"一边一只，天经地义——只要吧工牌藏好，就没有人能发现哩。","speaker":"狮子狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-995fbd9610f090df41e8","text":"别变回来了，回去镇风水。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-efdc6c1da0db072b4742","text":"总是保持一个姿势很辛苦的…您要是觉得好，让狸狸在年会上表演一下应该也足够了哩……","speaker":"狮子狸"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-c15daff95582ed6bf566","text":"我刚才还以为你要辞职呢。","speaker":""}]}
